                <pb facs="1172" n="1076" xml:id="pg1076"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 9 in No. 5.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Schmitt to Captain Gushing.</hi></head>
                <p>Virginius captured on high seas, 31st October, ten o’clock night; brought here
                    1st November, five o’clock, evening.</p>
                <p>Four shot on 4th. Yesterday Captain Fry and thirty-six others, mostly crew.
                    Twelve this morning. No telegraphic communication with the States or Havana.
                    Wrote consul-general; no reply yet. No American war-vessels about.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
